rial, possibly a loose or failed wrap, plus dated personal observations—not a certified joint, tool or shelter. No unattended labor, self-tightening, healing or automatic upkeep occurs. Existing environmental ageing continues during ordinary world time. There is no invented maintenance benefit or fee: inspect before later testing, and require separately paid, conserved physical work for any retie or repair not included here. No automatic communication or assistance: any other participant must independently communicate, learn where required and perform their own authorized actions. Do not change protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions. Establish all validations, progress, physical bounds and lifecycle rules in executable code before exposing execution.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No experience or pleasure is awarded for requesting, naming, registration, waiting, study completion or claimed mastery. Placing a wrap or receiving an unassessed result is not itself success or verified information gain. A completed, paid observation or test—including an informative failure—may feed the existing grounded-understanding rule only when its evidence establishes a personally applicable fact. Deduplicate by source components, relevant prior state, method, load/direction bounds and actual changed finding, across probe and this interface; do not reward the same tick-70 press evidence again. Use only existing coded reward limits, decay and cooldowns; if no compatible bounded evaluator exists, award zero rather than create one through this contract. Repeated unchanged tests do not create novelty rewards. Legitimate familiar practice may qualify only through an already established bounded practice rule, not merely an action count. No automatic satisfaction or ongoing process benefit is proposed. Physical comfort change is zero and remains subject to the global cap of 10; nutrition and satiety are not improved or reduced by a mood calculation.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable events for paid examination, each committed placement/wrap step, interruption, inspection, actual separation motion/load, slip/breakage, cancellation and recovery. Associate them with exact actor/process/trial/component IDs and actual positions, quantities, stage and evidence. Provide reusable source-bound metadata: component=vine-join-trial, branch centerlines and poses, vine path and endpoints, material colors inherited from actual sources, selected contact region, requested/attained test displacement and load, and states assessment-pending, geometry-unresolved, positioned, wrap-attempted, loose, testing, slipped, broken, response-unassessed, partly-recovered and recovered. Use a held-at-test-bounds label only after an actual supported test with its numeric bounds; never label the assembly strong, durable or useful. Render only completed physical changes, not planned wrap geometry as finished material. Missing geometry may be shown as a clearly marked planning overlay, not a fabricated specimen. Failed, interrupted and incomplete actions retain their actual partial state and cannot display success. Observation records remain personal until an actual communication event shares them; publicly visible physical changes do not broadcast private findings.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

